This Mypersona repo uses PERSONA.md as the canonical entry point. Read ./PERSONA.md and follow its directives. If PERSONA.md still contains {{slot}} placeholders, this is a fresh install — read bootstrap.md first and run the 5-question setup.

Mypersona is a portable persona layer + a thin curated KB, not a session memory engine. Short-term session memory belongs to the host's native memory — do not duplicate it here. Curate this repo (memory/semantic/entities, memory/procedural) only on explicit intent or when a durable persona/KB fact emerges. Never auto-edit consciousness/identity.md, subconscious/constraints.md, or memory/procedural/*.

See PERSONA.md §1 for the full contract and docs/frontmatter_schema.md for the schema.
